xt_representativeness":0.9380906224250793,"text_excerpt":"This is a small, artisanal bakery just off Magazine Street. In addition to breads and baguettes, they also have pies, croissants, and biscuits. I would highly recommend grabbing a cinnamon roll, made with fluffy layers of crispy dough and covered in cinnamon and sugar. They also carry local kombuchas and jams. The coffee here is amazing, and they use locally roasted beans (they were brewing Hey! when I was there). This is also a great spot to study or get some work done, as there are plently of tables and the building has a quiet and peaceful ambience. Street parking is easy to find, even on the weekends. The staff here are so incredibly nice and can recommend the best baked goods for wha..."},{"business_id":"1QJD4wh6gdlO6I1h0_FiZg","review_id":"nbjRc9akjNxmQHeQHRpdNQ","date":"2019-07-11T18:50:05","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9341686964035034,"text_excerpt":"Amazing pastries! Finally had a chance to stop by this new bakery/pastry shop. Got the butter croissant and cinnamon bun/roll. Both were really really good. I can't wait to try their other pastries and also their breads."},{"business_id":"1QJD4wh6gdlO6I1h0_FiZg","review_id":"Tpg4o0_hKvygAjaPbkoUSQ","date":"2020-01-11T18:38:54","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9289450645446777,"text_excerpt":"I've been following them since they opened. I read all the reviews, their recipes are original, the business itself seemed like it was a game changer in the baked goods community so I was dying to pay them a visit. This week I did. I love their location on Mag st and 9th st. It's a quite place beautifully set with natural light. Good for family, friends or when flying solo. Their carrot cake is very moist, I loved finding black sesame seeds. It gave a crunchy addition to the soft cake. The cream cheese icing was nice. Robust in texture but not overly sweet. Rye brownies are very rich in flavor, they have cocoa nibs and maldon salt. These are also moist and soft but do hold their shape qui..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"1QJD4wh6gdlO6I1h0_FiZg","photo_id":"7DRXobjJtlVkleNAifWNHw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/7DRXobjJtlVkleNAifWNHw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8669641017913818},{"business_id":"1QJD4wh6gdlO6I1h0_FiZg","photo_id":"fs3Audk2AhrQiWdRNr6nJw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/fs3Audk2AhrQiWdRNr6nJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8208715915679932},{"business_id":"1QJD4wh6gdlO6I1h0_FiZg","photo_id":"RWPYOicJw8ZR3DUnTk737g","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/RWPYOicJw8ZR3DUnTk737g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8137600421905518},{"business_id":"1QJD4wh6gdlO6I1h0_FiZg","photo_id":"F7eXujGRrSQlUjHoT2466A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/F7eXujGRrSQlUjHoT2466A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7973867058753967}]},"notebook_case":null}
